2. [integers.hpp](https://github.com/r-lib/cpp11/blob/500f642b4ea132ec8c168fc70a28e81e9510ece3/inst/include/cpp11/integers.hpp#L59) line 59: `inline typename r_vector<int>::proxy& r_vector<int>::proxy::operator=(const int& rhs)`

